  "label": "ableism stereotype",
  "description": "The meme relies on a harmful ableist stereotype that links physical disability (specifically hip pain) to a perceived lack of emotional expression or social conformity, and implies that such individuals are 'obedient' or passive. This stereotype degrades people with physical disabilities by associating their condition with passivity or social non-engagement.",
